e around the edges of the screen.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nGentle park ambience with distant birds and light wind through leaves continues throughout.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":10056,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"seed\":865761,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":2.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":null,\"input_video_secs\":3.0,\"src_video_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/seedance-ref.mp4\"],\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":null,\"draft_source_task_id\":null},\"task_output\":null,\"moderation\":null}"
